9.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:512.94pt\"><span style=\"background-color:inherit\">exclude the change in fair value of the cross-currency swaps attributable to the difference between the spot and</span></span><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.44pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"><span style=\"background-color:inherit\"> </span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:662.25pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:512.9pt\"><span style=\"background-color:inherit\">forward prices from the assessment of hedge effectiveness (the \"excluded component\"). Changes in the fair value</span></span><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.4pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"><span style=\"background-color:inherit\"> </span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:674.25pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:512.98pt\"><span style=\"background-color:inherit\">of the cross-currency swaps attributable to these excluded components are recorded to other comprehensive</span></span><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.48pt;position:va