</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.45pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:341pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:27.61pt\">up to </span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:77.11pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:57.42pt\"><ix:nonFraction unitRef=\"shares\" contextRef=\"c-536\" decimals=\"-5\" name=\"us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized\" scale=\"6\" id=\"f-1758\">150.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:134.53pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:427.93pt\"> shares of common stock (1) by us to, or through, a consortium of banks acting as our sales</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.46pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:353pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:512.89pt\">agents or (2) by a consortium of banks acting as forward sellers on behalf of any forward purchasers contemplated</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.39pt;position:var(-