', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.44pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:217pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:248.82pt\">applicable to those units at the time of such distribution).</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:298.32pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:239pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.93pt\">In order to maintain our status as a real estate investment trust (\"REIT\") for federal income tax purposes, we</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.43pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:251pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.86pt\">generally are required to distribute dividends to our stockholders aggregating annually at least 90% of our taxable</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.36pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:263pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.95pt\">income (excluding net capital gains), and we are subject to income tax to the extent we distribute less than 100% of</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.45pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:275pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:219.86pt\">our taxable income (including net capital gains).</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:269.36pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:16.79pt\"> In </span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:286.15pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:22.24pt\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:308.39pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:254.07pt\">, our cash distributions to common stockholders totaled</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.46pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:287pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:53.91pt\">$2.92&#160;billion</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:103.41pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:83.91pt\">, or approximately </span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:187.32pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:33.9pt\">149.1%</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:221.22pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:115.61pt\"> of our taxable income of </span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:336.83pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:53.91pt\">$1.96 billion</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:390.74pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:6.11pt\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:396.85pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:165.62pt\">Certain measures are available to us</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.47pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:299pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.88pt\">to reduce or eliminate our tax exposure as a REIT, and accordingly, no provision for U.S. federal income taxes,</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.38pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:311pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.97pt\">other than our taxable REIT subsidiaries (each, a \"TRS\"), has been made. Our taxable income reflects non-cash</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.47pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:323pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.94pt\">deductions for depreciation and amortization. Our taxable income is presented to show our compliance with REIT</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.44pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:335pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.99pt\">dividend requirements and is not a measure of our liquidity or operating performance.&#160;We intend to continue to</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.49pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:347pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.96pt\">make distributions to our stockholders that are sufficient to meet this dividend requirement and that will reduce or</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.46pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:359pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:512.98pt\">eliminate our exposure to income taxes. Furthermore, we believe our cash on hand and funds from operations are</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.48pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:371pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:419.03pt\">sufficient to support our current level of cash distributions to our stockholders. We distributed </span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:468.53pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:36.13pt\">$2.4345</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:504.66pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:57.78pt\"> per share to</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.44pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:383pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:106.92pt\">stockholders during the </span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:156.42000000000002pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:179.7pt\">nine months ended September 30, 2026</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:336.12pt;position:var(--position);white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:338.89pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:61.65pt\"> representing </span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:400.54pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:28.34pt\">72.7%</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:428.88pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:133.55pt\"> of our diluted Adjusted Funds</span><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:562.43pt;position:var(--position);text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:2.77pt\"> </span></div><div style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:10pt;position:var(--position);text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:395pt;width:612pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Arial', sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;left:49.5pt;position:var(--position);text-de